1. Real-Time Video Stream & Overlay
 Low-Latency Video Player: Live HD video feed with latency controls (under 500 ms ideal) and stream quality toggles (720p/1080p).
 Bounding Box Overlay: Visual bounding boxes around detected marine life with species label, confidence percentage (e.g., "Whale 94%"), and dynamic color-coding by category (e.g., green for mammals, yellow for turtles).
 Telemetry HUD: Fixed head-up display showing critical flight metrics:
 Drone Altitude (m), Speed (m/s), Heading (Yaw), Gimbal Pitch Angle.
 Current GPS position (Lat/Lon) and Battery % / Estimated Remaining Flight Time.
2. Map & Spatial Tracking
 Split/Side Panel Interactive Map: Integrated GIS map (OpenStreetMap/Mapbox) showing real-time drone track and target positions.
 Georeferenced Sightings: Real-time pins dropped automatically on the map corresponding to calculated target GPS coordinates.
 Geofencing & Search Grid: Visual overlay of pre-planned flight paths, survey coverage areas, and operational boundaries.
3. Sighting Log & Alerts
 Live Sighting Feed: Scrollable sidebar list showing recent detections sorted chronologically.
 Quick Verification: One-click confirmation/rejection actions for operators to manually validate AI detections (Human-in-the-Loop).
 Threshold Alerts: Audio/visual pop-up alerts for high-priority targets (e.g., endangered species or shark proximity to swimmer zones).
4. Usability & Environmental Requirements
 High-Contrast Outdoor Mode: Dark and high-contrast light themes designed for outdoor field operation under direct sunlight (tablet/laptop screens).
 Offline-First Resilience: Visual indicators for connection health (RTSP video stream, MAVLink telemetry, local logging state). Ability to cache logs locally when disconnected from cellular networks.
 Touch & Keyboard Friendly: Large touch-friendly control targets (minimum 48×48 px) for field tablets, alongside quick keyboard shortcuts for desktop operators (e.g., ⁠Space⁠ to log manually, ⁠Esc⁠ to clear alert).
5. Data Export & Analytics Review
 Playback & Replay Mode: Post-flight video scrubber synchronized with GPS map playback for reviewing past survey missions.
 Export Controls: One-click export of session data to CSV, GeoJSON, or PDF summary reports for research and compliance logging
